<section aria-labelledby="landscape-title" class="relative z-10 -mt-px overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.75rem] bg-bone text-charcoal shadow-[0_-30px_70px_-20px_rgba(9,17,12,0.55)] sm:rounded-t-[2.5rem]" id="course"><div class="px-5 pb-24 pt-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-36 lg:pt-32"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em]"><span class="tabular-nums">01</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>The landscape</span></p><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-muted-foreground">Dune · Pine · Heath · Ocean</p></div><h2 class="sr-only" id="landscape-title">The landscape</h2><p class="mt-12 max-w-[70rem] text-[clamp(1.65rem,3.7vw,3.6rem)] font-light leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] lg:mt-16" data-statement="true">Two hundred and forty hectares where the ocean, the pine forest and the open heath were <em class="font-serif font-normal">left to lead.</em> We didn't lay a course onto the land. We <em class="font-serif font-normal">uncovered</em> the one already inside it.</p><div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><figure class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A lone golfer carrying a bag along a dewy fairway at first light, with sea mist and pines beyond" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw" src="/images/golf-first-light.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 flex justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground"><span>First light on the opening fairway</span><span>Hole 1</span></figcaption></figure><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 lg:col-span-3 lg:py-8"><div data-reveal="true"><p class="max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75">The routing follows the natural contours from the first tee to the last green. There are no forced carries over manufactured lakes and no imported sand. The bunkers are the dunes, and the hazards are the ones the land already had.</p><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mt-8" href="/morrow/course"><span class="relative py-1">Explore the course<span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px origin-left bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-x-0 group-hover:origin-right"></span></span><span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-current/30 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:border-current"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-1 lg:gap-y-8"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">hectares of coastal estate</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.4vw,3.1rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="240" data-decimals="0">240</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">holes on the championship course, par 72</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.4vw,3.1rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="18" data-decimals="0">18</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">yards from the back tees</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.4vw,3.1rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="7048" data-decimals="0">7,048</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">of the estate left as native habitat</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.4vw,3.1rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="63" data-decimals="0">63</span>%</span></dd></div></dl></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:col-span-4 lg:pt-44"><figure><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/3] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="left"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="10"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A coastal golf course at golden hour, its fairway curving through dunes and umbrella pines toward the ocean" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, 100vw" src="/images/golf-hero.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center 55%;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 flex justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground"><span>Dune and pine along the front nine</span><span>Holes 2 to 4</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="ml-auto w-2/3"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-square rounded-[4px]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="6"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="Sculpted greens and white bunkers among umbrella pines, with the bay and mountains glowing at sunset" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 22vw, 66vw" src="/images/campaign/course-panorama.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:62% 74%;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">Bunkers cut from the natural dune</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section>
